@startuml usecase-place-and-pay-order
' BrewLite - Detailed Scope Use-Case Diagram: Place & Pay Order
' Author: TV4 (Backend - Order & Payment)
' Reviewer: TV1 (Tech Lead / DevOps)
' Task 1.3: D-09 (Refs #9)

skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

actor "Khách hàng (Customer)" as Customer
actor "Payment Mock Service" as PaymentGW
actor "Cơ sở dữ liệu (PostgreSQL)" as DB

rectangle "Phạm vi Use-case Trọng tâm: Đặt & Thanh toán Đơn hàng" {
  usecase "UC-06: Đặt hàng (Tạo đơn)" as UC_Order #DBEAFE
  usecase "UC-07: Thanh toán đơn hàng" as UC_Pay #DBEAFE
  usecase "UC-08: Kiểm tra & Trừ tồn kho" as UC_Stock
  usecase "UC-09: Xử lý Idempotency-Key" as UC_Idempotency
  usecase "UC-10: Tính giá chuẩn phía Server" as UC_ServerPrice
  usecase "UC-11: Rollback khi hết hàng" as UC_Rollback
  usecase "UC-12: Thử lại thanh toán khi lỗi" as UC_RetryPay
}

Customer --> UC_Order : 1. Xác nhận giỏ hàng & Đặt
Customer --> UC_Pay : 2. Chọn Ví/Thẻ & Thanh toán

UC_Order ..> UC_ServerPrice : <<include>>
UC_Order ..> UC_Stock : <<include>> (trong Transaction)
UC_Stock ..> UC_Rollback : <<extend>> (khi stock < qty)

UC_Pay ..> UC_Idempotency : <<include>>
UC_Pay ..> UC_RetryPay : <<extend>> (khi Payment FAILED)

UC_Stock --> DB : Execute atomic update
UC_Pay --> PaymentGW : Gửi yêu cầu trừ tiền mô phỏng

@enduml
